      "content": "The correct set from the following in which both pairs are in correct order of melting point is :",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "LiCl &gt; LiF ; NaCl &gt; MgO"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "LiCl &gt; LiF ; MgO &gt; NaCl"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "LiF &gt; LiCl ; NaCl &gt; MgO"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "LiF &gt; LiCl ; MgO &gt; NaCl"
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
        "D"
      ],
      "explanation": "<p>Correct option is i.e. LiF &gt; LiCl; MgO &gt; NaCl. Melting point is directly proportional to lattice energy. Lattice energy is the energy required to separate a mole of an ionic solid into gaseous ions. It depends upon charge of ions and size of ions.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.816ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22.11ex\" height=\"3.041ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -983.5 9772.7 1344\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1051,0)\"><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1329,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D443\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D443\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2080,0)\"><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2635.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"221D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3691.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4372.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4650.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5414.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5970.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"221D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(7026.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" tra